Yesterday morning I woke up very early.
There was terrible heat in Mumbai yesterday.
The air was very hot and humid.
I wanted to get away from this heat.
So I decided to go on a one-day trip to the hills.
I took out my own backpack from the cupboard.
I kept my water bottle in the bag.
There was strong sunlight outside right from the morning.
Therefore, I also kept my umbrella in the bag.
I kept my mobile and wallet in my pocket.
I put on my usual shoes.
Then I came out of the house and locked the door.
I came downstairs from the building.
The street outside was very quiet.
But despite it being morning time, I was sweating.
I started walking towards the bus stop to go to the station.
I wanted to experience the cool air in the hills soon.
